;   Disable to fix Tek railgun, Tek helmet, Snow Owl and Bloodtslaker vision
;   Warning: when the fix is activated plant species Z and beer will affect your vision, clear ; water vision will also be removed
;
;   If you start seeing every build black, just comment those 2 lines
;+CVars=ShowFlag.Materials=0
;+CVars=r.CustomDepth=0

;	Disable Adaptive Exposure
; --- r.EyeAdaptationQuality = 0 ---
; PT: Auto-exposição.
; EN: Eye adaptation.
; ARK: Caves.
; ON/OFF: 0.
; FX: 
+CVars=r.EyeAdaptationQuality=0

; [EN] Smoke, flamethrower, beer screen tied to particles.
; [PT] Fumaça, lança-chamas, blur beer ligados a partículas.
;   Enable to reduce a lot of particles (smoke grenade, flamethrower smoke, etc.)
;   Warning: Poison wyvern and basilisk poison balls are harder to see
; --- FX.MaxCPUParticlesPerEmitter = 1 ---
; PT: Partículas CPU/emissor.
; EN: CPU particles/emitter.
; ARK: Fogo, fumaça, veneno, beer FX.
; ON/OFF: 1 farm/pvp; gist usa 0-16.
; FX: 1 esconde veneno.
+CVars=FX.MaxCPUParticlesPerEmitter=1

; [EN] Foliage — may hide metal nodes/rocks.
; [PT] Folhagem — pode esconder metal/rochas.
; Enable to remove leaves and bushes
; Warning: Also remove some world meshes (rocks, metal nodes, crystals, etc.)
; have number as 2 for shorter than intended foliage view distance, or 0 for foliage, pearls and aberration rocks to be invisible
; --- foliage.UseOcclusionType = 0 ---
; PT: Oclusão folhagem.
; EN: Foliage occlusion.
; ARK: Árvores, nodes.
; ON/OFF: 0 farm/pvp.
; FX: 2=view distance curta.
+CVars=foliage.UseOcclusionType=0

; Need to be disabled if the above variable is enabled, otherwise can be enabled
; --- ShowFlag.VolumeLightingSamples = 0 ---
; PT: Volume lighting samples.
; EN: Volume lighting.
; ARK: Folhagem.
; ON/OFF: 0 com UseOcclusionType=0.
; FX: 
+CVars=ShowFlag.VolumeLightingSamples=0

; [EN] GameplayDebug=0 removes water overlay + more.
; [PT] GameplayDebug=0 remove superfície água e mais.
; Enable to remove water surface
; Warning: Also remove a lot of things (structure placement overlay, parasaur red detections, weapon projectiles, dino projectiles, loot crate beam, etc.)
;+CVars=ShowFlag.GameplayDebug=0

; [EN] Splines=0 removes drop/transmitter beams.
; [PT] Splines=0 remove feixe drop e transmitter.
; Enable to remove fog on island completely
; Warning: Also remove a lot of things (parasaur red detections, weapon projectiles, dino projectiles, loot crate beam, etc.)
;   also removes drop/loot crate beam, trasmitter light
;+CVars=ShowFlag.Splines=0

